      <div data-dc-tpl="422" style="font-size: 64px; font-weight: 700; background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgb(217, 40, 86), rgb(251, 176, 59)) text; line-height: 1; color: rgb(244, 247, 251) !important;">5</div>
